      "instance_name": "boy",
      "label": "child with Down syndrome",
      "description": "A young boy, likely with Down syndrome, is the central subject. He has short brown hair, wears blue-framed glasses, and is dressed in a red hooded jacket. He is seated on a swing, holding the chains, and looking directly at the camera with an expression that could be interpreted as curious or slightly confused. His appearance is the focal point of the meme's visual material.",
